  "content_id": "16136220",
  "title": "PulseChain PLS Network Fees",
  "description": "PulseChain (PLS) – Fast and Cheap Ethereum Alternative\nPulseChain is designed to lower costs compared to Ethereum.\nHow PLS Fees Work\n\n\nGas...",
  "body": "<h1 id=\"h_01JSZ4NNQ80SX9G1QMDKRGZY5M\">PulseChain (PLS) – Fast and Cheap Ethereum Alternative</h1><p class=\"no-margin\">PulseChain is designed to lower costs compared to Ethereum.</p><h2 id=\"h_01JSZ4NNQ8JMH6PF3KPDMCKJVC\">How PLS Fees Work</h2><ul><li><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Gas fees</b> measured in <b>PLS tokens</b>.</p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Dynamic based on network congestion</b>.</p></li></ul><p class=\"no-margin\">Edge calculates the recommended gas fee automatically.</p><hr><h2 id=\"h_01JSZ4NNQ82J1G0HJ8TKRKH666\">Fee Options Available</h2><ul><li><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>High</b></p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Optimal (default)</b></p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Low</b></p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Custom</b></p></li></ul><hr><h2 id=\"h_01JSZ4NNQ86N17KNPP34HRZ6WS\">Average Cost</h2><p class=\"no-margin\">Typically <b>$0.001 to $0.01 USD</b>.</p><hr><h2 id=\"h_01JSZ4NNQ87QPRZAXW3EJ844RJ\">Why It Matters</h2><p class=\"no-margin\">PulseChain brings Ethereum apps cheaper to life. Edge makes sure your fees stay tiny and confirmations quick.</p>",
